# Nomad AI — secrets for a local Cloudflare run.
#
# Wrangler reads .dev.vars, not .env, and makes these `env.*` inside the
# functions in functions/api/:
#
#   wrangler pages dev           serves the folder and both functions
#
# Copy to .dev.vars and fill in. .dev.vars is gitignored; this file is not.
# .env still exists for the Netlify CLI and the node scripts — the two are
# separate files with the same values, so change both or neither.
#
# On the deployed site these are set on the Pages project as encrypted
# Secrets, never as plain variables:
#
#   wrangler pages secret put GEMINI_API_KEY
#   wrangler pages secret put TWOGIS_API_KEY
#
# ⚠ GEMINI_API_KEY is the same key the Next.js project in
#   Downloads/nomad-ai uses. Anything that exposes it here exposes it there
#   too — mint a separate restricted key before publishing.

GEMINI_API_KEY=
TWOGIS_API_KEY=
